## RowStore integration
# entrystore.rowstore.url=http://localhost:8282/

## SSRF whitelist for the resource-DELETE proxy path
## (DELETE /{context}/resource/{id}?proxy=true on Link/Reference/LinkReference entries).
## Entries are ORIGIN URLs (scheme://host:port), NOT bare hostnames — this differs from
## the proxy-GET whitelist `entrystore.proxy.whitelist.local`, which is host-only.
## http://x normalizes to http://x:80 and https://x to https://x:443. The origin of
## entrystore.rowstore.url above (when set) is implicitly trusted for the DELETE path,
## so single-host RowStore deployments need no additional configuration here.
# entrystore.proxy.remote-resource.delete.whitelist.1=http://rowstore.internal:8282
# entrystore.proxy.remote-resource.delete.whitelist.2=https://other-rowstore.example.com

